WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,240
Then can I go?

2
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:06,240
Of course

3
00:00:06,240 --> 00:00:10,240
But I hope you can stay.

4
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:12,240
Definitely do it next time

5
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:19,730
Come and play when you have time, handsome boy

6
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:27,180
Brother, you have such strong taste

7
00:00:27,180 --> 00:00:35,060
Brother, are you okay?

8
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:38,220
I was almost dragged into the bathtub by that female ghost

9
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:40,470
Thank you, Lao Su

10
00:00:40,470 --> 00:00:42,470
If you hadn't given me those ghost arms in the first place

11
00:00:42,470 --> 00:00:46,650
I'll die, little master

12
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:49,640
If not for system limitations

13
00:00:49,640 --> 00:00:51,640
i can give you more
